## Tips for Safe Online Shopping

Ensure you're getting a genuine TwinMOS product every time:

1. **Buy from the official store first** — [twinmos.com/shop](https://www.twinmos.com/shop/) guarantees authenticity.
2. **Check seller ratings** — on marketplaces like Amazon and Noon, look for sellers with 95%+ positive ratings.
3. **Look for "Official TwinMOS Store"** badges on marketplace listings.
4. **Verify the model number** — match the product model against our [official product pages](/products).
5. **Check warranty terms** — genuine TwinMOS RAM and SSDs carry a 3-year manufacturer warranty; flash drives and USB products carry a 2-year warranty.
6. **Avoid suspiciously low prices** — if the price is more than 30% below market rate, treat it as a red flag.

[Learn about the TwinMOS Anti-Counterfeit Program](/news-events/2026-q2-anti-counterfeit-program)

